+           "marks": [
+             "a2ae8165b4df"
+           ],
+           "text": "Sohag"
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "d15ffc6eec59",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": ", Egypt, embodies a rich tapestry of history and culture that extends far beyond its geographic boundaries. This town, more than a mere suburban area, is deeply entrenched in the annals of history, rising from the ancient Egyptian town of Ipu. Its existence offers a seamless blend of the past and present, serving as a poignant reminder of a civilization that once thrived here. "
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "c12d6a8b68f3",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [
