+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "d4462d035707",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " foundation is steeped in a history that traces back to a pre-dynastic era, making it older than the well-documented Egyptian dynasties that have captivated the world’s imagination."
+         }
