+           "_key": "7f597e2803a7",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " is celebrated for its enduring contribution to Egypt’s cultural heritage, especially through its ancient crafts in weaving, textiles, and drapery. These trades are among "
