+           "_key": "e3f183c1815f",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " that is central to its identity. The marketplaces near the open-air museum are a testament to this, offering a glimpse into the skilled artistry that defines Akhmim. Here, visitors have the unique opportunity to engage with the town’s "
+         },
