+           "_key": "49f8c1b8d142",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " legacy, witnessing first-hand the creation of exquisite textiles and potentially taking home a piece of this enduring heritage. Akhmim, therefore, stands not just as a town but as a living museum, a "
